From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): separate worker lifecycle from orchestration authority

Live board sessions route work; dispatcher-assigned workers own execution
lifecycle. Sharing one prompt and tool gate let an unscoped orchestrator
complete, block, or heartbeat tasks it did not own.

Select role guidance from trusted process context, expose complete, block, and
heartbeat only to workers, and allow orchestrators to unblock only after the
recorded blocker is confirmed resolved. Internal recovery retains unscoped
handlers without exposing those lifecycle transitions to the model.
---
